  "version": "0.1.9",
  "notes": "### Fixed\n- Late checkout can be approved ahead of time. The time list now follows the reservation's departure date instead of today's clock, so a 12:30 late checkout for tomorrow can be selected today. Past times are greyed out only when the departure is today.\n- Approving a late checkout in advance no longer opens the Checkout dialog or posts the fee early. The time and agreed fee are recorded; the fee posts on the departure day when the desk applies it, and only then does checkout continue.\n\n### Added\n- An approved late checkout is shown on the Departures tab, the tape chart details, and the reservation details (\"late checkout 12:30 · $25.00 on departure\").\n- Confirmed (not yet arrived) reservations can carry an approved late checkout time.\n- Applying a different late-checkout fee after one has already posted is refused with a clear message instead of being silently ignored.",
